    "sub_name": "有機與量子點半導體顯示技術及應用",
    "sub_ename": "ORGANIC AND QUANTUM DOTS LIGHT EMITTING SEMICONDUCTOR FOR DISPLAY TECHNOLOGY AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "當前及下世代的新型顯示器技術, 例如目前時下最熱門的Smart Phone及Wall Paper電視所使用的面板, 均屬於此技術領域。此課程將會學習到有機與量子點半導體: a. 發光原理, b. 元件結構, c. 製程技術, d. 封裝方法, e. 背板(電晶體)架構, 與 f. 光學設計模擬",
    "describe_eh": "New display technologies of the current and next generations, such as the current most popular Smart Phone and Wall Paper TV panels, all belong to this technical field. In this course, you will learn about organic and Smart Phone quantum dot semiconductors: a. luminescence principle, b. device structure, c. process technology, d. encapsulation method, e. backplane (transistor) architecture, and f. optical design simulation",
    "pre_subname": "OPT2002光學(二)、OPT2007應用電子學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "OPT2002",
    "pre_sub_ename": "OPT2002 OPTICS (2)、OPT2007 APPLIED ELECTRONICS(2)",
